# Legacy Inventory System Documentation

This document detailes the workflows and fields extracted from the legacy inventory management system at `https://staging-store.parwestgroup.com/`.

## 1. Product Management

### Products (`/products/create`)
**Workflow:** Define core items, handling both regular products and weapons.
**Fields:**
- `Product Name` (Text)
- `Product Code` (Text)
- `Product Category` (Dropdown)
- `Product Unit` (Dropdown)
- `Weapon Type` (Dropdown - Optional)
- `Calibre` (Dropdown - Optional)
- `Description` (Textarea)
- `Product Image` (File Upload)
- `Has Variant` (Checkbox)

### Categories (`/categories`)
**Fields:**
- `Name` (Text)
- `Parent Category` (Dropdown)
- `Assignee` (Checkboxes: Guard, Employee, Client)

### Variations (`/variations`)
**Fields:**
- `Category` (Dropdown)
- `Type` (Dropdown, e.g., Size)
- `Name` (Text, e.g., "32", "34")

### Supporting Attributes
- **Brands:** `Name` (Text)
- **Units:** `Name` (Text)
- **Statuses:** `Name` (Text), `Category` (Dropdown)
- **Conditions:** `Name` (Text)

## 2. Warehousing & Stores

### Stores (`/stores`)
**Workflow:** Manage physical locations and regional hubs.
**Fields:**
- `Warehouse Name` (Dropdown)
- `Region Name` (Text)
- `Prefix` (Text, e.g., 'L' for Lahore)
- `Head Office` (Checkbox/Toggle)
- `Landline` (Text)
- `Mobile No` (Text)
- `Address` (Textarea)
- `Latitude` (Coordinate)
- `Longitude` (Coordinate)

## 3. Inventory Tracking

### Regular Inventory (`/inventories/regular`)
**Columns:** Store, Product, Variant, Type, Caliber, Category, Total Qty.

### Weapon/Ammunition Inventory (`/inventories/weapon`, `/inventories/ammunition`)
**Columns:** Total Qty, Available Qty, Assigned Qty, Reusable Qty, Damaged Qty, Condemned Qty.

### Unique Items (`/product-unique-items`)
**Workflow:** Tracking serialized weapons.
**Fields:**
- `Product` (Dropdown)
- `Weapon Number` (Text)
- `Unique Number` (Text)
- `License Number` (Text)

## 4. Core Workflows

### Purchases (`/purchases/create/regular`)
**Workflow:** Receiving new stock from vendors.
**Fields:**
- `Store/Warehouse` (Select2)
- `Vendor` (Select2)
- `Purchase Date` (Date)
- `Attachment Invoices` (File)
- `Product Search` (Autocomplete)
- `Product Table` (Qty, Price)
- `Note` (Text)
- `Approval Reference` (Text)
- `Invoice Number` (Text)

### Demands (Internal Transfers) (`/demands_send/create`)
**Workflow:** Requesting stock movement between warehouses.
**Fields:**
- `From Store` (Dropdown)
- `To Warehouse` (Dropdown)
- `Product Search` (Autocomplete)
- `Products Table` (Required Quantity)
- `Requested Remarks` (Text)

### Adjustments (`/adjustments/create/regular`)
**Workflow:** Manual stock correction.
**Fields:**
- `Store/Warehouse` (Dropdown)
- `Product Search` (Autocomplete)
- `Products Table` (Current Stock, Adjustment Type: Addition/Subtraction)
- `Note` (Text)

### Assignments
- **Guard Assignment (`/inventory-assignements/create`):** Store, Guard Search (Parwest ID), Date, Product Search, Products Table (Qty, Condition), Remarks.
- **Client Assignment (`/client-assignments/create`):** Store, Client, Branch, Date, Product Search, Products Table.

## 5. System Logs

### Audit Log (`/audits`)
**Filters:** User, Model, Event (Created/Updated/Deleted), Date Range.
